paperwallet-tools (0.1.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Depend on libsecp256k1-6 or libsecp256k1-2, so that the package also
    installs on Debian 13 trixie.
  * Activate the single-binary dh addon explicitly and let dh_gencontrol
    apply the relationship substvars, silencing the build warnings.

